Okay. I've written a preliminary tinfoil hat patch [1].

At the moment, it is a very cut down version of your
suggestion. A tinfoil hat obviously has no defense
value, but it blocks telepathy - both your outgoing
telepathy and mind flayers' incoming telepathy.

I'd make it also block clairvoyance, but the current
code infrastructure only supports armour which blocks
a single intrinsic.

At the moment it is exceedingly rare. Ie, it has 
probability zero. I make upgrade that to 1, if I'm
feeling generous.

I want to add some flavour text for it, but I'm not
sure what the format for the data file is. Anyone got
any hints?

